# | Moxa ioLogik E2212 Ethernet Remote I/O — 12-channel DO + 12-channel DI + 4-channel DIO
# | 
# | Source: ioLogik E2200 Series User Manual Edition 7.0, September 2018 (Appendix I)
# | Protocol: Modbus/TCP port 502
# | 
# | FC01 (0xxxx R/W): DO bit ctrl ch0-11 (0x0000-0x002F), DI counter ctrl (0x0030-0x0077),
# | DIO ctrl (0x0080-0x008F), DI ch12-15 counter ctrl (0x0090-0x00B7)
# | FC02 (1xxxx R): DI bit value ch0-15 (0x0000-0x000F)
# | FC04 (3xxxx R): DI count value u32 hi+lo ch0-15 (0x0000-0x001F)
# | FC03 (4xxxx R/W): primary register space below; Citect compatibility block also in FC03
@mbmap=1
@vendor=Moxa
@model=ioLogik E2212
@description=12-DO + 12-DI + 4-DIO Modbus/TCP Ethernet remote I/O (port 502). FC03: DO_pulseOutputCount u32 hi+lo ch0-11 (0-23), DO_pulseLowWidth ch0-11 (24-35), DO_pulseHighWidth ch0-11 (36-47), DO_mode ch0-11 (48-59, 0=DO 1=Pulse), DI_countFilter ch0-11 (60-71), DI_mode ch0-11 (72-83, 0=DI 1=Count), DO_value Citect ch0-11 (0x0054-0x005F), DO_powerOnValue Citect (0x0060-0x006B), DO_safeModeValue Citect (0x006C-0x0077), DI_counterTrigger ch0-11 (0x00C0-0x00CB, 0=L2H 1=H2L), DIO_direction ch0-3 (0x00F0-0x00F3, 1=output-DO 0=input-DI), IntReg00-23 initial (0x0178-0x018F) working (0x0B68-0x0B7F), DI_counterModeValue ch0-11 (0x0D00-0x0D0B). FC04: DI_countValue u32 hi+lo ch0-15 (0x0000-0x001F). FC01: DO bit ctrl (0-47), DI counter ctrl (48-119), DIO ctrl (128-143). FC02: DI_bitValue ch0-15 (0-15).
